WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Final design review. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Present a sourced visual argument

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A design review argues from evidence: requirements, views, dimensions, interfaces and unresolved questions. A polished render is not verification.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Present one visible claim, one supporting drawing, one counterexample to check and one next measurement.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Portfolio critique

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A view supports interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance alone.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Present a sourced visual argument
